  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a Nice to meet you! What are you up to today?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI'm ChatGPT! \ud83d\ude04 You can call me GPT if you want. Nice to meet you, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udf7f Here\u2019s my 20 best Tamil movies list \u2014 mixing classics, action, comedy, romance, crime, and emotional masterpieces.\n\n\ud83c\udfac Nayakan (1987) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Anbe Sivam (2003) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Madhavan\n\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Vikram Vedha (2017) \u2014 Madhavan, Vijay Sethupathi\n\n\u2764\ufe0f 96 (2018) \u2014 Vijay Sethupathi, Trisha\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Ratsasan (2018) \u2014 Vishnu Vishal\n\n\ud83d\udc51 Pariyerum Perumal (2018) \u2014 Kathir, Anandhi\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Kaithi (2019) \u2014 Karthi\n\n\u2694\ufe0f Theeran Adhigaaram Ondru (2017) \u2014 Karthi\n\n\ud83d\ude02 Panchathanthiram (2002) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83d\udca5 Vada Chennai (2018) \u2014 Dhanush\n\n\ud83c\udf1f Soorarai Pottru (2020) \u2014 Suriya\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Sarpatta Parambarai (2021) \u2014 Arya\n\n\ud83d\udc7d Maanaadu (2021) \u2014 Silambarasan\n\n\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Maanagaram (2017) \u2014 Sri, Sundeep Kishan\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Alaipayuthey (2000)\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT",
